WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.701
-I want to say congrats on
"White Lotus."

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.367
I want to talk about it
because you just nailed it.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.501
I mean, it was a home run,
buddy.

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:06.300
You are so good in that.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.634
But before we get into that,

00:00:07.634 --> 00:00:10.133
I want to say that we've had

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:13.200
many guests on our show that
have done impressions of you.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.400
-Yeah.
-Yeah, and great ones.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.567
-Who would have thought?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:19.400
-But if you're up for it,

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.834
I'd love to show
a few of these impressions.

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:22.767
-Oh, yeah. I think I know --

00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:24.667
I know some great ones
I've seen on Instagram.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:25.667
Okay, yeah. Who do you got?

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:28.133
-Chloe Fineman was here.
-Oh, my God.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:30.334
-Here's her Jennifer Coolidge
impression.

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:34.133
-Oh, I'm going to make you
a pie, dumbass!

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.601
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:00:36.601 --> 00:00:39.200
-Is that amazing?
-It is. It's amazing.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.167
You know, it's so weird
because you don't really know

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:45.734
who you are ever, really,
you know, in an objective point

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:47.200
you know, sort of perspective.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:50.534
But then you see people and
you're like, "That's who I am?"

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:51.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:54.234
They do you and you're like,
"Oh, alright. I'll take it."

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:56.968
I mean, she -- I liked that.
-But when you get in the zone.

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:59.701
But the first time I think
I heard anyone do an impression

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:03.033
of you is when Ariana Grande was
here a few years ago.

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:06.234
And here's Ariana's impression
of Jennifer.

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:11.834
-God, you look like
the Fourth of July.

00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:13.834
I'm taking the dog, dumbass.

00:01:13.834 --> 00:01:15.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:17.334
-I know.
-Come on!

00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:19.801
-I know.
-Ariana Grande crushing it.

00:01:19.801 --> 00:01:22.334
That's a great impression.
-I know. Unbelievable.

00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:25.501
But, you know, you should know
that it was sort of

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:28.734
the beginning of a lot of cool
things that happened for me

00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:30.234
because -- I don't know --

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:33.567
I sort of, you know,
I was going through a dead zone.

00:01:33.567 --> 00:01:36.367
And not much was going on.

00:01:36.367 --> 00:01:40.167
And then Ariana did
this imitation on your show,

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:41.901
and you encouraged her.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:45.834
And then this ball got rolling.

00:01:45.834 --> 00:01:50.734
I mean, you know, my friend
who's like her age, Teresa,

00:01:50.734 --> 00:01:52.100
she was like, "Hey, you know,

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:56.534
you should DM Ariana
and just say, you know --"

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:58.167
because I thought it was
such a good imitation.

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:01.868
And I was like, "No, she's got
like 260 million followers.

00:02:01.868 --> 00:02:03.367
Those are robots.

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:06.133
The robots answer the DMs

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:08.000
and we will never ever
get to her, whatever."

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.801
And then I did it anyway and
then this response came back.

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:15.601
And then, next thing you know,
I was going to her house

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:19.300
getting fit for a wardrobe
fitting for "Thank U, Next."

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:22.801
So that was all because of
Jimmy Fallon. Yes.

